\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; margin-right: 5px; margin-left: 5px; margin-bottom: 3px; float: none; max-width: calc(100% - 10px); text-align: center; width: 23px;\" src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205002122571/original/bIoagum0Y3-zmwsI8o946jXBmp0BBV3RsQ.png?1760540201\" class=\"fr-dii\">Common Fix: </strong>Add a common fix to the issue at hand.</span></code></pre><p><br></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\"><code dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; margin-right: 5px; margin-left: 5px; margin-bottom: 3px; float: none; max-width: calc(100% - 10px); text-align: center; width: 23px;\" src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205002122637/original/d9W5VZMfgSmWN_vHrKoTUVS9taovDrl8LA.png?1760540258\" class=\"fr-dii\">Reminder: </strong>Only administrators with permission or organisation owners can reset login access for others.</span></code></pre><p><br></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\"><code dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; margin-right: 5px; margin-left: 5px; margin-bottom: 3px; float: none; max-width: calc(100% - 10px); text-align: center; width: 23px;\" src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205003806565/original/9MmHNXaCJR_YRu7rA4Qf4-UX-YQsITelXw.png?1764847083\" class=\"fr-dii\">Warning: </strong>Only administrators with permission or organisation owners can reset login access for others.</span></code></pre><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Nuances</strong></span></span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The default colour is 264966 but when you click text colour it will say it is black. To change a <strong>Header</strong> or <strong>Bold</strong> text you must click the black square to change the colour. Then you <strong>MUST</strong> click the trash icon when you switch back to standard text as the default.</span></p>"
